        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I only remember the noise, the screaming, and then. Silence and blood...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the accident, I woke up in some dark wasteland where time had stopped, and the world looked like it had been dying for centuries. I looked for help, for a way out. For any sign of life. But what I found was... different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can feel the darkness everywhere. Not the ordinary kind... it's heavy, suffocating, alive. I have this feeling something is watching me. Maybe it's this place. Maybe it's those... creatures. Demons? I don't know. I don't want to know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Another crumbling corridor, traps, and... who are you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D platformer with environmental puzzles, arcade elements, and secret artifacts to discover. This game puts a strong emphasis on atmosphere. 18 levels, no dialogue, no hints, you have to discover everything on your own.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I only remember the noise, the screaming, and then. Silence and blood...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the accident, I woke up in some dark wasteland where time had stopped, and the world looked like it had been dying for centuries. I looked for help, for a way out. For any sign of life. But what I found was... different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can feel the darkness everywhere. Not the ordinary kind... it's heavy, suffocating, alive. I have this feeling something is watching me. Maybe it's this place. Maybe it's those... creatures. Demons? I don't know. I don't want to know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Another crumbling corridor, traps, and... who are you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D platformer with environmental puzzles, arcade elements, and secret artifacts to discover. This game puts a strong emphasis on atmosphere. 18 levels, no dialogue, no hints, you have to discover everything on your own.</p>",
        "short_description": "You woke up after the accident, and now you're looking for help and a way out of this dark land. Surrounded by darkness, traps, and... those creatures... you come across him...",
